{"3125970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ECHO OF FEAR: Vol.1 Night Visit", "steam_appid": 3125970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FIRST EPISODE IS FREE TO PLAY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ECHO OF FEAR is a psychological horror game where you play as a detective who receives a box containing 3 mysterious videotapes. Each tape represents a separate story connected by a common plot. The plot is based on the Cthulhu myths by H.P. Lovecraft. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are watching the first part of the ECHO OF FEAR anthology.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125970/extras/f118414ec311425476d6c14d2df98dc0.poster.avif?t=1773940672\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125970/extras/f118414ec311425476d6c14d2df98dc0.webm?t=1773940672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125970/extras/f118414ec311425476d6c14d2df98dc0.mp4?t=1773940672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ECHO OF FEAR: Vol.1 Night Visit</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the first episode of &quot;ECHO OF FEAR,&quot; the detective watches a videotape titled &quot;Night Visit.&quot; You play as Louis Langridge, who decides to take a shortcut to the city of Arkham via a country road. But when a rainstorm begins, he seeks shelter in a lonely house. What could go wrong?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a first-person narrative walking simulator with item carrying and exploration mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul clas